  "question": "De oppervlakte van een rechthoek is A = b × h. Als A = 48 m² en b = 6 m, wat is h? (in meters)",
  "answer": 8,
  "hint1": "Maak h vrij: h = A ÷ b.",
  "hint2": "h = 48 ÷ 6 = 8.",
  "optionalWorkedFirstStep": "h = A / b = 48 / 6.",
  "explanation": "h = 8 m.\n\nA = b × h\n48 = 6 × h\nh = 48 ÷ 6 = 8\n\nControle: 6 × 8 = 48 ✓"
}
